          <span style="width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--border);"></span>
          <span>Reading Time: <strong>11 min read</strong></span>
          <span style="width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--border);"></span>
          <span style="background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Household &amp; Industrial Cleaners</span>
